description	"Darth Revan - 'The Revanchist'

A Dark Lord of the Sith seeking to conquer the galaxy to prepare it against a far greater evil.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- RoF: 1.1x
- Lightsaber
-- Saber Defense (3)
-- Blaster Defense/Deflect (2)
-- Special Damage: 1.25x
-- Saber Throw (2) ^3[CS1]
--- Damage: 45
> Single (Yellow/Red/Blue)
-- Damage: 240/300/130
> Dual (Dual/Blue/Yellow)
-- Damage: 260/130/240

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (2)
- Pull (2)
- Sense (2)

^8Attributes:
- Healing (1)
- Force Block/Focus (2)
- Fury (1)
- Rally"